1. Create a canvas element with the desired width and height.
2. Set the background color of the canvas to a light gray.

```javascript
const canvas = document.getElementById('canvas');
const width = 800;
const height = 600;
const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
ctx.fillStyle = 'lightgray';
ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);
```

